--!strict
-- RuneforgeScreen.lua
-- CTRBLXAI | Runeforge full screen (v2 build step 5, 2026-11-01). Same frame as the Merchant /
-- Blacksmith screens (GuildScreen + item tile grid).
--
-- Layout:
--   LEFT   Forge tab: [Gears | Gems] swap (2026-11-07, user request). Gears = item tile grid
--          (Common-Epic items); Gems = rune gem tiles (RuneforgeGemGrid), same tile size.
--          Reroll tab: item tile grid of items above Epic.
--   RIGHT  [Forge][Reroll] sub-tabs, then a scroll list of forge details only: the item's
--          current lines, the bonus budget, the gems picked so far, and the server's price /
--          result preview
--   BOTTOM ONE row, lower right:
--          Forge tab:  [? = guide] [Minus = remove last pick] [Confirm] [X = clear picks] [Back]
--          Reroll tab: [? = guide] [Confirm] [Back]. Pay first (USER RULING 2026-11-07):
--          Confirm first PAYS the sulfur and only then shows the new sets; after that Confirm
