--   No helper text on the screen (2026-11-07, user request): how-to lives in the (?) guide
--   (FacilityInfo); what a bonus does lives in the bonus inspector (BonusInspector).
--   Confirm always opens a prompt that needs a second confirmation.
-- Forging and rerolling commit straight away on Confirm (no basket). Every price and result
-- comes from the server (PreviewForge / GetRerollSets / PayReroll); the client sends ids only (SEC-002).
-- Display + input only (ARC-001). Context is nil-safe (ARC-006).

